@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Failure Classification, Safe Feedback and Recovery
start
:Observe failure / rejection at owning operation;
:Keep correlation and stable operation identity;
if (Expected input / authority / conflict outcome?) then (yes)
 :Map documented bounded response;
 :Record only necessary diagnostic / audit metadata;
else (no)
 if (Effect completion uncertain?) then (yes)
  :Preserve recorded state and protected references;
  :Expose contract-defined pending / unknown outcome;
  :Resolve same operation under current authority;
 else (no)
  :Classify dependency or unexpected failure;
  :Capture restricted sanitized diagnostics;
  :Return safe unavailable / failure response;
 endif
endif
:Select owner-controlled correction, retry or reconciliation;
:Verify actual recovery result without fabricating success;
stop
@enduml
